{"schemaVersion":1,"id":45,"sections":[{"id":"116010-PROLOGUE","name":"第 1 战 · 战前","scripts":[1500],"start":0,"count":17},{"id":"116010-EPILOGUE","name":"第 1 战 · 战后","scripts":[11490],"start":17,"count":7},{"id":"116011-PROLOGUE","name":"第 2 战 · 战前","scripts":[1510],"start":24,"count":4},{"id":"116011-EPILOGUE","name":"第 2 战 · 战后","scripts":[11500],"start":28,"count":20},{"id":"116012-PROLOGUE","name":"第 3 战 · 战前","scripts":[1520],"start":48,"count":17},{"id":"116012-EPILOGUE","name":"第 3 战 · 战后","scripts":[11510],"start":65,"count":13},{"id":"116013-PROLOGUE","name":"第 4 战 · 战前","scripts":[1530],"start":78,"count":20},{"id":"116013-EPILOGUE","name":"第 4 战 · 战后","scripts":[11520],"start":98,"count":14},{"id":"116014-PROLOGUE","name":"第 5 战 · 战前","scripts":[1540],"start":112,"count":31},{"id":"116014-EPILOGUE","name":"第 5 战 · 战后","scripts":[11530],"start":143,"count":22}],"frames":[{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"116010-PROLOGUE:1500:2","scriptId":1500,"text":"教官随手揍飞了几只战车兽，很快就到了我们这边。而阿芙罗拉则继续剿灭战车兽。","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-04.webp","left":null,"right":null,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":3,"speaker":"指挥官","player":true,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"116010-PROLOGUE:1500:3","scriptId":1500,"text":"（简直就是暴力的化身……不过谢天谢地终于等到了援军，不然我们小队可是要交代在这儿了……）","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-04.webp","left":3,"right":null,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":3,"speaker":"指挥官","player":true,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"116010-PROLOGUE:1500:4","scriptId":1500,"text":"“那边那位也是援军，没见过吗？也是学院的学生？”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-04.webp","left":3,"right":null,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":211,"speaker":"索菲亚·马利诺夫娜","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"116010-PROLOGUE:1500:5","scriptId":1500,"text":"“不是，那是我临时征召的边防队伍，就是之前卓娅的那个小队。”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-04.webp","left":3,"right":211,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":3,"speaker":"指挥官","player":true,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"116010-PROLOGUE:1500:6","scriptId":1500,"text":"“哦，是这样啊。”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-04.webp","left":3,"right":211,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"116010-PROLOGUE:1500:7","scriptId":1500,"text":"原来是卓娅所在的那个队伍，看上去挺强的。","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-04.webp","left":3,"right":211,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":211,"speaker":"索菲亚·马利诺夫娜","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"116010-PROLOGUE:1500:8","scriptId":1500,"text":"“不过话说回来，卓娅和嘉莉娜呢……”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-04.webp","left":3,"right":211,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"116010-PROLOGUE:1500:9","scriptId":1500,"text":"教官环视了周围，看来还有别的援军，只是分开行动了。","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-04.webp","left":3,"right":211,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":211,"speaker":"索菲亚·马利诺夫娜","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"116010-PROLOGUE:1500:10","scriptId":1500,"text":"“算了，卓娅她们应该稍后也会赶到，确认过人员没事的话，那我就去对付‘主要嘉宾’～杂鱼就交给你们了。”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-04.webp","left":3,"right":211,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"116010-PROLOGUE:1500:11","scriptId":1500,"text":"用膝盖想也知道，教官的目标肯定锁定了埃普西隆。","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-04.webp","left":3,"right":211,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":3,"speaker":"指挥官","player":true,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"116010-PROLOGUE:1500:12","scriptId":1500,"text":"“既然教官这么说了，那么我们这边就以周边的小群战车兽为主要清理对象了。”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-04.webp","left":3,"right":211,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":31,"speaker":"佐伊·谢尔曼","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"116010-PROLOGUE:1500:13","scriptId":1500,"text":"“是。”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-04.webp","left":3,"right":31,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":133,"speaker":"达利波娃·戈沃罗夫娜","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"116010-PROLOGUE:1500:14","scriptId":1500,"text":"“有教官吸引主要火力的话，应该没什么问题。”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-04.webp","left":133,"right":31,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":175,"speaker":"伊诺·赞佩里尼","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"116010-PROLOGUE:1500:15","scriptId":1500,"text":"“不知道教官对付埃普西隆行不行……”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-04.webp","left":133,"right":175,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":121,"speaker":"芙琳·勒布","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"116010-PROLOGUE:1500:16","scriptId":1500,"text":"“虽然数量还是很多，但是教官亲自来援护……真是给我们打了一剂强心针啊，肯定没问题的。”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-04.webp","left":121,"right":175,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":3,"speaker":"指挥官","player":true,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"116010-PROLOGUE:1500:17","scriptId":1500,"text":"“别激动，你们还是有伤在身的，注意量力而行。”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-04.webp","left":121,"right":3,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":119,"speaker":"芙琳·勒布","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"116010-PROLOGUE:1500:18","scriptId":1500,"text":"“是～”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-04.webp","left":119,"right":3,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"116010-EPILOGUE:11490:2","scriptId":11490,"text":"被突如其来的援军打乱了阵脚，埃普西隆显得非常愤怒。","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-04.webp","left":119,"right":3,"section":1,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":47,"speaker":"埃普西隆","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-009.webp","id":"116010-EPILOGUE:11490:3","scriptId":11490,"text":"“该死的东西，又是你！？”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-04.webp","left":47,"right":3,"section":1,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"116010-EPILOGUE:11490:4","scriptId":11490,"text":"埃普西隆定睛一看，原来是之前和自己在马奇诺研究所过过招的钢舞姬。","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-04.webp","left":47,"right":3,"section":1,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":211,"speaker":"索菲亚·马利诺夫娜","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"116010-EPILOGUE:11490:5","scriptId":11490,"text":"“不要你你你的，我是索菲亚·马利诺夫娜，好好记下这个将要打败你的人的名字吧～”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-04.webp","left":47,"right":211,"section":1,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":47,"speaker":"埃普西隆","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-009.webp","id":"116010-EPILOGUE:11490:6","scriptId":11490,"text":"“就凭你？再来一百个我也能照单全收！！”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-04.webp","left":47,"right":211,"section":1,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":219,"speaker":"索菲亚·马利诺夫娜","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"116010-EPILOGUE:11490:7","scriptId":11490,"text":"“那就接招吧！”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-04.webp","left":47,"right":219,"section":1,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"116010-EPILOGUE:11490:8","scriptId":11490,"text":"霎时间炮火纷飞，看得出教官和埃普西隆一开始就打算火力全开。","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-04.webp","left":47,"right":219,"section":1,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"116011-PROLOGUE:1510:2","scriptId":1510,"text":"由于教官和埃普西隆打得不可开交，为避免殃及池鱼，我们远远得避开，开始清理周边的战车兽。","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-04.webp","left":47,"right":219,"section":2,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":3,"speaker":"指挥官","player":true,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"116011-PROLOGUE:1510:3","scriptId":1510,"text":"“我们去援护那个阿芙罗拉吧，反正教官这里一时半会儿应该没什么问题。”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-04.webp","left":3,"right":219,"section":2,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"116011-PROLOGUE:1510:4","scriptId":1510,"text":"我指了指在侧翼单兵作战的钢舞姬。","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-04.webp","left":3,"right":219,"section":2,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":115,"speaker":"芙琳·勒布","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"116011-PROLOGUE:1510:5","scriptId":1510,"text":"“恩，既然长官这么说，那么我们赶快行动吧。”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-04.webp","left":115,"right":219,"section":2,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"116011-EPILOGUE:11500:0","scriptId":11500,"text":"清理掉了一些战车兽后，我们小队和阿芙罗拉合流了。","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-04.webp","left":115,"right":219,"section":3,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":3,"speaker":"指挥官","player":true,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"116011-EPILOGUE:11500:2","scriptId":11500,"text":"“你就是阿芙罗拉吧，刚才教官有提到过你。”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-04.webp","left":3,"right":219,"section":3,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":511,"speaker":"阿芙罗拉","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"116011-EPILOGUE:11500:3","scriptId":11500,"text":"“恩……”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-04.webp","left":3,"right":511,"section":3,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"116011-EPILOGUE:11500:4","scriptId":11500,"text":"这位钢舞姬脸上略带羞涩，大概比较怕生吧。","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-04.webp","left":3,"right":511,"section":3,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":3,"speaker":"指挥官","player":true,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"116011-EPILOGUE:11500:5","scriptId":11500,"text":"“真是厉害啊，这么多战车兽都是你一个人干掉的，简直和教官差不多了。”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-04.webp","left":3,"right":511,"section":3,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":511,"speaker":"阿芙罗拉","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"116011-EPILOGUE:11500:6","scriptId":11500,"text":"“还好……”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-04.webp","left":3,"right":511,"section":3,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"116011-EPILOGUE:11500:7","scriptId":11500,"text":"不得不说，阿芙罗拉娇好的面容上连一点汗都没有出，这等战斗力肯定也是不同凡响……","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-04.webp","left":3,"right":511,"section":3,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":3,"speaker":"指挥官","player":true,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"116011-EPILOGUE:11500:8","scriptId":11500,"text":"“那么暂时先清理另一边的战车兽吧，教官那边短时间内应该还没有问题。”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-04.webp","left":3,"right":511,"section":3,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":511,"speaker":"阿芙罗拉","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"116011-EPILOGUE:11500:9","scriptId":11500,"text":"“诶？好，好的……”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-04.webp","left":3,"right":511,"section":3,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"116011-EPILOGUE:11500:10","scriptId":11500,"text":"看到略带犹豫的阿芙罗拉，佐伊忍不住插话了。","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-04.webp","left":3,"right":511,"section":3,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":40,"speaker":"佐伊·谢尔曼","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"116011-EPILOGUE:11500:11","scriptId":11500,"text":"“长官，你没看到人家有点害怕吗？不要老是一副自来熟的样子和其他妹子搭讪。”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-04.webp","left":40,"right":511,"section":3,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":3,"speaker":"指挥官","player":true,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"116011-EPILOGUE:11500:12","scriptId":11500,"text":"“啊！？是这样！？啊，不好意思不好意思……”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-04.webp","left":3,"right":511,"section":3,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":3,"speaker":"指挥官","player":true,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"116011-EPILOGUE:11500:13","scriptId":11500,"text":"“我是教官的学生，同时也是这个临时小队的指挥官，请多指教。”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-04.webp","left":3,"right":511,"section":3,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"116011-EPILOGUE:11500:14","scriptId":11500,"text":"我这才想起来自我介绍都没说……想来刚才确实有自说自话……","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-04.webp","left":3,"right":511,"section":3,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":511,"speaker":"阿芙罗拉","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"116011-EPILOGUE:11500:15","scriptId":11500,"text":"“没关系，我是阿芙罗拉，边防支队的队员之一。”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-04.webp","left":3,"right":511,"section":3,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"116011-EPILOGUE:11500:16","scriptId":11500,"text":"果然和佐伊说的一样，正式的自我介绍以后，阿芙罗拉略带僵硬的表情好了不少……","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-04.webp","left":3,"right":511,"section":3,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":37,"speaker":"佐伊·谢尔曼","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"116011-EPILOGUE:11500:17","scriptId":11500,"text":"“长官就是那么神经大条，不用和他一般见识。我是佐伊·谢尔曼，叫我佐伊就好了～”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-04.webp","left":37,"right":511,"section":3,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":511,"speaker":"阿芙罗拉","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"116011-EPILOGUE:11500:18","scriptId":11500,"text":"“好的，佐伊～”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-04.webp","left":37,"right":511,"section":3,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"116011-EPILOGUE:11500:19","scriptId":11500,"text":"如此一番，其他的队员也开始介绍起自己。","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-04.webp","left":37,"right":511,"section":3,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":3,"speaker":"指挥官","player":true,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"116011-EPILOGUE:11500:20","scriptId":11500,"text":"（额，看来在社交这方面以后还得要向佐伊学习一下……）","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-04.webp","left":3,"right":511,"section":3,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"116012-PROLOGUE:1520:2","scriptId":1520,"text":"战斗到一半，听到远处有熟悉的声音，是卓娅！","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-04.webp","left":3,"right":511,"section":4,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"116012-PROLOGUE:1520:3","scriptId":1520,"text":"于是我们又和卓娅合流了。","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-04.webp","left":3,"right":511,"section":4,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":163,"speaker":"卓娅·朱可娃","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"116012-PROLOGUE:1520:4","scriptId":1520,"text":"“哦呀，这不是指挥官么，好久不见啊，没想到这次侦查任务是你在指挥。”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-04.webp","left":163,"right":511,"section":4,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":3,"speaker":"指挥官","player":true,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"116012-PROLOGUE:1520:5","scriptId":1520,"text":"“哈哈，还好啦，还不是那副狼狈样，多亏教官及时相助。”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-04.webp","left":163,"right":3,"section":4,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":3,"speaker":"指挥官","player":true,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"116012-PROLOGUE:1520:6","scriptId":1520,"text":"“那个……你旁边这位是？”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-04.webp","left":163,"right":3,"section":4,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"116012-PROLOGUE:1520:7","scriptId":1520,"text":"我指了指卓娅旁边银发的钢舞姬，这次我可不会再犯刚才的错误了……","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-04.webp","left":163,"right":3,"section":4,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":163,"speaker":"卓娅·朱可娃","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"116012-PROLOGUE:1520:8","scriptId":1520,"text":"“啊，光顾聊天了，这位是嘉莉娜，我们小队的。”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-04.webp","left":163,"right":3,"section":4,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":523,"speaker":"嘉莉娜","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"116012-PROLOGUE:1520:9","scriptId":1520,"text":"“你好～”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-04.webp","left":163,"right":523,"section":4,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":3,"speaker":"指挥官","player":true,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"116012-PROLOGUE:1520:10","scriptId":1520,"text":"“你好。”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-04.webp","left":3,"right":523,"section":4,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":163,"speaker":"卓娅·朱可娃","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"116012-PROLOGUE:1520:11","scriptId":1520,"text":"“话说阿芙罗拉也在啊，教官呢？”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-04.webp","left":163,"right":523,"section":4,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":511,"speaker":"阿芙罗拉","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"116012-PROLOGUE:1520:12","scriptId":1520,"text":"“教官正在和埃普西隆战斗，我们这边清理完的话就过去帮忙吧。”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-04.webp","left":163,"right":511,"section":4,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":163,"speaker":"卓娅·朱可娃","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"116012-PROLOGUE:1520:13","scriptId":1520,"text":"“恩，我看看。”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-04.webp","left":163,"right":511,"section":4,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"116012-PROLOGUE:1520:14","scriptId":1520,"text":"卓娅环视了一下周围的情况。","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-04.webp","left":163,"right":511,"section":4,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":163,"speaker":"卓娅·朱可娃","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"116012-PROLOGUE:1520:15","scriptId":1520,"text":"“恩，不好办啊……”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-04.webp","left":163,"right":511,"section":4,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":523,"speaker":"嘉莉娜","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"116012-PROLOGUE:1520:16","scriptId":1520,"text":"“确实，周围的战车兽虽然已经处理掉不少了，但是从远方赶过来的还是不少啊。”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-04.webp","left":163,"right":523,"section":4,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":3,"speaker":"指挥官","player":true,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"116012-PROLOGUE:1520:17","scriptId":1520,"text":"“不过既然都汇合了，那么就往教官方向行动吧，如果能集中火力快速打败埃普西隆的话，就能撤退了吧。”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-04.webp","left":3,"right":523,"section":4,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"116012-PROLOGUE:1520:18","scriptId":1520,"text":"对于我的提议，大家点头表示赞同，于是我们开始往教官方向靠拢。","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-04.webp","left":3,"right":523,"section":4,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":3,"speaker":"指挥官","player":true,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"116012-EPILOGUE:11510:2","scriptId":11510,"text":"“教官，我们已经就位，援护就交给我们吧。卓娅她们也到了！”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-04.webp","left":3,"right":523,"section":5,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"116012-EPILOGUE:11510:3","scriptId":11510,"text":"很快，我们就赶到了教官附近。","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-04.webp","left":3,"right":523,"section":5,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":211,"speaker":"索菲亚·马利诺夫娜","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"116012-EPILOGUE:11510:4","scriptId":11510,"text":"“很好，埃普西隆，听到了没？从目前状态来说，是对你不利哦～”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-04.webp","left":3,"right":211,"section":5,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"116012-EPILOGUE:11510:5","scriptId":11510,"text":"教官这番话就好像是故意说给埃普西隆听的。","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-04.webp","left":3,"right":211,"section":5,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":47,"speaker":"埃普西隆","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-009.webp","id":"116012-EPILOGUE:11510:6","scriptId":11510,"text":"“哼，酒囊饭袋多几个也是一样！！”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-04.webp","left":47,"right":211,"section":5,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":3,"speaker":"指挥官","player":true,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"116012-EPILOGUE:11510:7","scriptId":11510,"text":"（故意激怒埃普西隆好让她不选择撤退？教官真是好心计。）","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-04.webp","left":47,"right":3,"section":5,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"116012-EPILOGUE:11510:8","scriptId":11510,"text":"从教官和埃普西隆的状态来说，教官占据上风，或者说可能是刚才偷袭埃普西隆得手的关系，埃普西隆一开始就处于弱势。","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-04.webp","left":47,"right":3,"section":5,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":3,"speaker":"指挥官","player":true,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"116012-EPILOGUE:11510:9","scriptId":11510,"text":"“最好是能活捉啊～”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-04.webp","left":47,"right":3,"section":5,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":137,"speaker":"达利波娃·戈沃罗夫娜","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"116012-EPILOGUE:11510:10","scriptId":11510,"text":"“原来长官好这口～那种怪物都在守备范围之内？”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-04.webp","left":137,"right":3,"section":5,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":40,"speaker":"佐伊·谢尔曼","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"116012-EPILOGUE:11510:11","scriptId":11510,"text":"“噫……”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-04.webp","left":137,"right":40,"section":5,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":120,"speaker":"芙琳·勒布","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"116012-EPILOGUE:11510:12","scriptId":11510,"text":"“不是吧……”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-04.webp","left":120,"right":40,"section":5,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":3,"speaker":"指挥官","player":true,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"116012-EPILOGUE:11510:13","scriptId":11510,"text":"“别开玩笑……我的意思是埃普西隆这种高智能的家伙身上肯定有不少情报。”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-04.webp","left":120,"right":3,"section":5,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"116012-EPILOGUE:11510:14","scriptId":11510,"text":"以现在的情况来看，活捉埃普西隆应该没什么问题。","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-04.webp","left":120,"right":3,"section":5,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":49,"speaker":"埃普西隆","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-009.webp","id":"116013-PROLOGUE:1530:2","scriptId":1530,"text":"“呜啊！”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-04.webp","left":49,"right":3,"section":6,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"116013-PROLOGUE:1530:3","scriptId":1530,"text":"埃普西隆虽然挡住了教官的正面攻击，但是仍旧被我们从背后的空隙连续命中。","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-04.webp","left":49,"right":3,"section":6,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":211,"speaker":"索菲亚·马利诺夫娜","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"116013-PROLOGUE:1530:4","scriptId":1530,"text":"“干得好，准备投降吧，埃普西隆，我们并没打算杀你。”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-04.webp","left":49,"right":211,"section":6,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":47,"speaker":"埃普西隆","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-009.webp","id":"116013-PROLOGUE:1530:6","scriptId":1530,"text":"“真是讨厌！”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-04.webp","left":47,"right":211,"section":6,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"116013-PROLOGUE:1530:7","scriptId":1530,"text":"埃普西隆已经单膝跪地，刚才的那几下看来对她造成了不小的伤害。","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-04.webp","left":47,"right":211,"section":6,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"116013-PROLOGUE:1530:8","scriptId":1530,"text":"这时一道声音响起。","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-04.webp","left":47,"right":211,"section":6,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":56,"speaker":"兰布达","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-009.webp","id":"116013-PROLOGUE:1530:9","scriptId":1530,"text":"“你们应该适可而止吧，当时没杀你们，不要得寸进尺了。”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-04.webp","left":47,"right":56,"section":6,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":220,"speaker":"索菲亚·马利诺夫娜","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"116013-PROLOGUE:1530:10","scriptId":1530,"text":"“谁！！？？”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-04.webp","left":220,"right":56,"section":6,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"116013-PROLOGUE:1530:11","scriptId":1530,"text":"埃普西隆的身边凭空出现一道白光，从白光中缓缓走出一个熟悉的身影。","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-04.webp","left":220,"right":56,"section":6,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":48,"speaker":"埃普西隆","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-009.webp","id":"116013-PROLOGUE:1530:12","scriptId":1530,"text":"“兰布达～太好了，来得真是时候！”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-04.webp","left":48,"right":56,"section":6,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"116013-PROLOGUE:1530:13","scriptId":1530,"text":"面对突然乱入的敌人，教官和我们都摆出了一副警觉的态势。","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-04.webp","left":48,"right":56,"section":6,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":220,"speaker":"索菲亚·马利诺夫娜","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"116013-PROLOGUE:1530:14","scriptId":1530,"text":"“不管你是谁，我都要在这里让你们乖乖投降！”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-04.webp","left":48,"right":220,"section":6,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":56,"speaker":"兰布达","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-009.webp","id":"116013-PROLOGUE:1530:15","scriptId":1530,"text":"“我比较讨厌暴力，但是你们既然穷追不舍，那么我就和你们过几下招吧。”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-04.webp","left":56,"right":220,"section":6,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":48,"speaker":"埃普西隆","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-009.webp","id":"116013-PROLOGUE:1530:16","scriptId":1530,"text":"“别忘了，还有我～”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-04.webp","left":56,"right":48,"section":6,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":56,"speaker":"兰布达","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-009.webp","id":"116013-PROLOGUE:1530:17","scriptId":1530,"text":"“随你的便，波长都那么紊乱了，还是不要来凑热闹了。”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-04.webp","left":56,"right":48,"section":6,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":48,"speaker":"埃普西隆","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-009.webp","id":"116013-PROLOGUE:1530:18","scriptId":1530,"text":"“不用操心，我可没那么脆弱。”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-04.webp","left":56,"right":48,"section":6,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"116013-PROLOGUE:1530:19","scriptId":1530,"text":"就在这时，听到米佳那边传来的声音。","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-04.webp","left":56,"right":48,"section":6,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":504,"speaker":"米佳·叶戈罗夫娜","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"116013-PROLOGUE:1530:20","scriptId":1530,"text":"“大批战车兽向着这里靠近，而且速度极快！”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-04.webp","left":504,"right":48,"section":6,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":220,"speaker":"索菲亚·马利诺夫娜","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"116013-PROLOGUE:1530:21","scriptId":1530,"text":"“啧……”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-04.webp","left":504,"right":220,"section":6,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"116013-PROLOGUE:1530:22","scriptId":1530,"text":"由于兰布达的出现，情况急转直下。","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-04.webp","left":504,"right":220,"section":6,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"116013-EPILOGUE:11520:0","scriptId":11520,"text":"交战时间拖的越久，战车兽群就越多。","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-04.webp","left":504,"right":220,"section":7,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":211,"speaker":"索菲亚·马利诺夫娜","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"116013-EPILOGUE:11520:2","scriptId":11520,"text":"“可恶，为什么打不中！”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-04.webp","left":504,"right":211,"section":7,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"116013-EPILOGUE:11520:3","scriptId":11520,"text":"如教官所说，兰布达对于教官的所有攻击均一一闪过，而且是那种最小幅度的精确闪避，没有擦到分毫，刚好躲过。","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-04.webp","left":504,"right":211,"section":7,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"116013-EPILOGUE:11520:4","scriptId":11520,"text":"而我们从死角的偷袭，都被埃普西隆完全封锁，非常讨厌。","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-04.webp","left":504,"right":211,"section":7,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":56,"speaker":"兰布达","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-009.webp","id":"116013-EPILOGUE:11520:5","scriptId":11520,"text":"“没用的，你的攻击倾向都已经通过波长被我知晓。”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-04.webp","left":56,"right":211,"section":7,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"116013-EPILOGUE:11520:6","scriptId":11520,"text":"兰布达耸了耸肩，又一次闪过了索菲亚的攻击。","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-04.webp","left":56,"right":211,"section":7,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":220,"speaker":"索菲亚·马利诺夫娜","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"116013-EPILOGUE:11520:7","scriptId":11520,"text":"（这家伙难道能读心！？）","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-04.webp","left":56,"right":220,"section":7,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":56,"speaker":"兰布达","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-009.webp","id":"116013-EPILOGUE:11520:8","scriptId":11520,"text":"“差不多，至少能很明确的感知到你现在的困惑。”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-04.webp","left":56,"right":220,"section":7,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":220,"speaker":"索菲亚·马利诺夫娜","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"116013-EPILOGUE:11520:9","scriptId":11520,"text":"“！！！！”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-04.webp","left":56,"right":220,"section":7,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":56,"speaker":"兰布达","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-009.webp","id":"116013-EPILOGUE:11520:10","scriptId":11520,"text":"“所以说了，单挑你不可能是我的对手。”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-04.webp","left":56,"right":220,"section":7,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":220,"speaker":"索菲亚·马利诺夫娜","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"116013-EPILOGUE:11520:11","scriptId":11520,"text":"“可恶！”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-04.webp","left":56,"right":220,"section":7,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"116013-EPILOGUE:11520:12","scriptId":11520,"text":"面对兰布达的感知能力，教官完全被压制了。","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-04.webp","left":56,"right":220,"section":7,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":3,"speaker":"指挥官","player":true,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"116013-EPILOGUE:11520:13","scriptId":11520,"text":"（不妙，兰布达的这个能力怎么破除呢……）","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-04.webp","left":3,"right":220,"section":7,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"116013-EPILOGUE:11520:14","scriptId":11520,"text":"如果无法应对兰布达这个能力，我们肯定是毫无胜算的……就和当初刚遇见埃普西隆一样。","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-04.webp","left":3,"right":220,"section":7,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"116014-PROLOGUE:1540:2","scriptId":1540,"text":"大好局势因为兰布达的出现而被完全颠覆了。","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-04.webp","left":3,"right":220,"section":8,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"116014-PROLOGUE:1540:3","scriptId":1540,"text":"兰布达和埃普西隆的协力非常完美，埃普西隆的死角被很好的弥补。","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-04.webp","left":3,"right":220,"section":8,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":220,"speaker":"索菲亚·马利诺夫娜","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"116014-PROLOGUE:1540:4","scriptId":1540,"text":"“呼……呼……”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-04.webp","left":220,"right":220,"section":8,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"116014-PROLOGUE:1540:5","scriptId":1540,"text":"索菲亚教官已经开始喘气，然而兰布达只是静静地冷眼看着他。","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-04.webp","left":220,"right":220,"section":8,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":511,"speaker":"阿芙罗拉","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"116014-PROLOGUE:1540:6","scriptId":1540,"text":"“虽然索菲亚喜欢单独作战，但现在好像已经不是袖手旁观的地步了。”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-04.webp","left":220,"right":511,"section":8,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"116014-PROLOGUE:1540:7","scriptId":1540,"text":"这时候阿芙罗拉终于按耐不住了。","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-04.webp","left":220,"right":511,"section":8,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":511,"speaker":"阿芙罗拉","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"116014-PROLOGUE:1540:8","scriptId":1540,"text":"“卓娅，剩下的战车兽就交给你们了……”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-04.webp","left":220,"right":511,"section":8,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"116014-PROLOGUE:1540:9","scriptId":1540,"text":"说罢，阿芙罗拉蜷起身子进入了蓄力状态，看上去就像短跑运动员准备起跑时的动作。","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-04.webp","left":220,"right":511,"section":8,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":511,"speaker":"阿芙罗拉","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"116014-PROLOGUE:1540:10","scriptId":1540,"text":"“哈！”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-04.webp","left":220,"right":511,"section":8,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"116014-PROLOGUE:1540:11","scriptId":1540,"text":"接着阿芙罗拉大声一喝，整个身子像子弹一样朝着目标冲去，而目标正是埃普西隆。","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-04.webp","left":220,"right":511,"section":8,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":56,"speaker":"兰布达","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-009.webp","id":"116014-PROLOGUE:1540:12","scriptId":1540,"text":"“埃普西隆，闪开！”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-04.webp","left":56,"right":511,"section":8,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"116014-PROLOGUE:1540:13","scriptId":1540,"text":"兰布达察觉到了阿芙罗拉的行动，对埃普西隆发出了警告。","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-04.webp","left":56,"right":511,"section":8,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"116014-PROLOGUE:1540:14","scriptId":1540,"text":"然而这警告来得有些迟，阿芙罗拉以惊人的速度重重得撞在了埃普西隆身上，埃普西隆则像弹球一样被撞飞了。","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-04.webp","left":56,"right":511,"section":8,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":49,"speaker":"埃普西隆","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-009.webp","id":"116014-PROLOGUE:1540:15","scriptId":1540,"text":"“啊！！！”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-04.webp","left":56,"right":49,"section":8,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"116014-PROLOGUE:1540:16","scriptId":1540,"text":"被撞飞的埃普西隆过了好久才蹒跚地站了起来。在场的人，除了索菲亚、卓娅和嘉莉娜以外都惊呆了。","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-04.webp","left":56,"right":49,"section":8,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":211,"speaker":"索菲亚·马利诺夫娜","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"116014-PROLOGUE:1540:17","scriptId":1540,"text":"“……”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-04.webp","left":211,"right":49,"section":8,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":40,"speaker":"佐伊·谢尔曼","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"116014-PROLOGUE:1540:18","scriptId":1540,"text":"“这是什么速度……好强，简直就和换了个人一样……”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-04.webp","left":40,"right":49,"section":8,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":169,"speaker":"卓娅·朱可娃","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"116014-PROLOGUE:1540:19","scriptId":1540,"text":"“那是当然，阿芙罗拉的战斗力和索菲亚是不相伯仲的，特别是她认真起来的时候，更容易爆发出势不可挡的战斗力。”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-04.webp","left":40,"right":169,"section":8,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":41,"speaker":"佐伊·谢尔曼","player":true,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"116014-PROLOGUE:1540:20","scriptId":1540,"text":"“什么意思？听不太懂……”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-04.webp","left":41,"right":169,"section":8,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":523,"speaker":"嘉莉娜","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"116014-PROLOGUE:1540:21","scriptId":1540,"text":"“简单的来说短时间内大幅提高自己的各项能力，不过负担挺大的，所以她一般也不会轻易用。”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-04.webp","left":41,"right":523,"section":8,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":3,"speaker":"指挥官","player":true,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"116014-PROLOGUE:1540:22","scriptId":1540,"text":"“这是过热反应？通过加速燃烧体内的能量来短时间获得能力提升。”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-04.webp","left":3,"right":523,"section":8,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":169,"speaker":"卓娅·朱可娃","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"116014-PROLOGUE:1540:23","scriptId":1540,"text":"“不愧是优等生，很懂嘛。”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-04.webp","left":3,"right":169,"section":8,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":123,"speaker":"芙琳·勒布","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"116014-PROLOGUE:1540:24","scriptId":1540,"text":"“长官的好博学！”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-04.webp","left":3,"right":123,"section":8,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":3,"speaker":"指挥官","player":true,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"116014-PROLOGUE:1540:25","scriptId":1540,"text":"“哪里哪里……”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-04.webp","left":3,"right":123,"section":8,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"116014-PROLOGUE:1540:26","scriptId":1540,"text":"感受到芙琳和伊诺她们那边投来敬佩的目光，有种背脊发痒的感觉……","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-04.webp","left":3,"right":123,"section":8,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"116014-PROLOGUE:1540:28","scriptId":1540,"text":"另一边，阿芙罗拉对索菲亚行了个礼。","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-04.webp","left":null,"right":123,"section":8,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":511,"speaker":"阿芙罗拉","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"116014-PROLOGUE:1540:29","scriptId":1540,"text":"“不好意思，打扰了……不过为了速战速决，我觉得还是一起上会比较有效率。”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-04.webp","left":null,"right":511,"section":8,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"116014-PROLOGUE:1540:30","scriptId":1540,"text":"索菲亚点了点头。虽然觉得不甘心，但是眼前的敌人确实不适合继续单兵挑战了。","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-04.webp","left":null,"right":511,"section":8,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":56,"speaker":"兰布达","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-009.webp","id":"116014-PROLOGUE:1540:31","scriptId":1540,"text":"“就算多一个人也不会让你们变得有利，死心吧。”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-04.webp","left":56,"right":511,"section":8,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"116014-PROLOGUE:1540:32","scriptId":1540,"text":"兰布达摆了摆手。虽然摆着轻蔑的态度，但是她也暗自警觉了起来，毕竟看了刚才阿芙罗拉的那一击，知道这家伙也绝非等闲之辈。","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-04.webp","left":56,"right":511,"section":8,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":211,"speaker":"索菲亚·马利诺夫娜","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"116014-PROLOGUE:1540:33","scriptId":1540,"text":"“那可不一定。”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-04.webp","left":56,"right":211,"section":8,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"116014-EPILOGUE:11530:1","scriptId":11530,"text":"虽然兰布达的感知能力可以提前预判索菲亚和阿芙罗拉的动作，但是由于阿芙罗拉的速度远超过自己的预期，兰布达不得不从闪避调整为防守。","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-04.webp","left":56,"right":211,"section":9,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"116014-EPILOGUE:11530:2","scriptId":11530,"text":"每次的攻击都勉强挡下来的兰布达渐渐得开始展现出疲态。","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-04.webp","left":56,"right":211,"section":9,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"116014-EPILOGUE:11530:3","scriptId":11530,"text":"埃普西隆的战斗力已经不能期待，兰布达已经感觉到接下来局势肯定会对自己不利。","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-04.webp","left":56,"right":211,"section":9,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":56,"speaker":"兰布达","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-009.webp","id":"116014-EPILOGUE:11530:4","scriptId":11530,"text":"“看来你们还真不是嘴上说说的，低估了你们的战斗能力。”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-04.webp","left":56,"right":211,"section":9,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":511,"speaker":"阿芙罗拉","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"116014-EPILOGUE:11530:5","scriptId":11530,"text":"“谢谢你的评价……”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-04.webp","left":56,"right":511,"section":9,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":211,"speaker":"索菲亚·马利诺夫娜","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"116014-EPILOGUE:11530:6","scriptId":11530,"text":"“怎么样？现在投降还来得及。”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-04.webp","left":56,"right":211,"section":9,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":56,"speaker":"兰布达","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-009.webp","id":"116014-EPILOGUE:11530:7","scriptId":11530,"text":"“我觉得比起我这边，还是先想想怎么救援伏龙芝吧。”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-04.webp","left":56,"right":211,"section":9,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"116014-EPILOGUE:11530:8","scriptId":11530,"text":"兰布达脸上出现一丝冷笑，她突然提到了伏龙芝不禁让索菲亚心里一惊。","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-04.webp","left":56,"right":211,"section":9,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":220,"speaker":"索菲亚·马利诺夫娜","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"116014-EPILOGUE:11530:9","scriptId":11530,"text":"“你说什么！！？？”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-04.webp","left":56,"right":220,"section":9,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":56,"speaker":"兰布达","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-009.webp","id":"116014-EPILOGUE:11530:10","scriptId":11530,"text":"“你们回去就知道了……埃普西隆走了。”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-04.webp","left":56,"right":220,"section":9,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"116014-EPILOGUE:11530:11","scriptId":11530,"text":"说罢兰布达拉起一旁埃普西隆的手，同时兰布达的身上开始闪起白光。","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-04.webp","left":56,"right":220,"section":9,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":3,"speaker":"指挥官","player":true,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"116014-EPILOGUE:11530:12","scriptId":11530,"text":"“教官！那是传送！她们要逃了！”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-04.webp","left":56,"right":3,"section":9,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"116014-EPILOGUE:11530:13","scriptId":11530,"text":"看到兰布达身上的白光，我立刻叫了起来。","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-04.webp","left":56,"right":3,"section":9,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":220,"speaker":"索菲亚·马利诺夫娜","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"116014-EPILOGUE:11530:14","scriptId":11530,"text":"“恩！？难道那个时候的传送！？阿芙罗拉，攻击！”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-04.webp","left":56,"right":220,"section":9,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":511,"speaker":"阿芙罗拉","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"116014-EPILOGUE:11530:15","scriptId":11530,"text":"“诶！？”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-04.webp","left":511,"right":220,"section":9,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"116014-EPILOGUE:11530:16","scriptId":11530,"text":"教官的判断慢了一拍，再加上阿芙罗拉的犹豫，才使得敌人有了得以逃脱的间隙。","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-04.webp","left":511,"right":220,"section":9,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"116014-EPILOGUE:11530:17","scriptId":11530,"text":"当阿芙罗拉反应过来开始准备攻击的时候，兰布达和埃普西隆已经化为一道白光消失在众人的面前。","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-04.webp","left":511,"right":220,"section":9,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":220,"speaker":"索菲亚·马利诺夫娜","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"116014-EPILOGUE:11530:18","scriptId":11530,"text":"“可恶！！竟然让她们逃了。”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-04.webp","left":511,"right":220,"section":9,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":511,"speaker":"阿芙罗拉","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"116014-EPILOGUE:11530:19","scriptId":11530,"text":"“对不起……”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-04.webp","left":511,"right":220,"section":9,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":211,"speaker":"索菲亚·马利诺夫娜","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"116014-EPILOGUE:11530:20","scriptId":11530,"text":"“算了……都已经发生了，就别在意了。我们还是快点回伏龙芝，我有一股非常不祥的预感……”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-04.webp","left":511,"right":211,"section":9,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":511,"speaker":"阿芙罗拉","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"116014-EPILOGUE:11530:21","scriptId":11530,"text":"“那么，收队！”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-04.webp","left":511,"right":211,"section":9,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"116014-EPILOGUE:11530:22","scriptId":11530,"text":"阿芙罗拉代替教官发出了收队的命令。","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-04.webp","left":511,"right":211,"section":9,"shake":false}],"summaries":["教官的援军终于赶到了","交战中的相遇","卓娅她们也赶到了，感觉局势一片大好。","情况又一次急转直下……","打破战局的计谋"]}
